        "id": 1000056
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-03-24T19:22:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So, if an alarm is raised and is not in the config then it will be discarded unless it is critical?",
      "parentUuid": "ba092121_47e8587c",
      "revId": "5c6d30374e07f62dfc63a9921a5623c87bc45da2",
      "serverId": "2a2bfe1b-c5c2-48ed-9ac8-16438ab24388",
